: null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Start three eligible tracks using exact stage prerequisites, not whole-sprint barriers. Language track is SP01 then SP02 then SP03."}, {"id": "roadmap_native_feasibility_track", "label": "Native Feasibility Track SP01 F0-SP04-SP06", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Native feasibility/proofs track: SP01 F0 then SP04 then SP06. Language and native feasibility work can progress independently until their acceptance boundary."}, {"id": "roadmap_preview_integration_track", "label": "Preview Integration Track SP05", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Financial Preview integration from accepted atomic plus loan/swap subset into SP05. SP09.1 atomic F3 joins SP05/SP06 early; the full successor joins after SP07/SP08."}, {"id": "roadmap_mc01", "label": "MC01 Bounded Language and Developer-Facing Semantics", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Acceptance: supported language profile has a tested frontend/evaluator/lowering and current scoped audits. This does not establish native proofs or financial corpus conformance."}, {"id": "roadmap_mc01_atomic", "label": "MC01-ATOMIC", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Existing atomic profile after input correction, applicable checks and current candidate-bound implementation audits. Only this milestone gates the initial financial/native experiments. Remains the existing source/evaluator comparison prerequisite."}, {"id": "roadmap_mc01_extensions", "label": "MC01-EXTENSIONS", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Remaining source/IR expansions. Full RP01 gates those successor profiles, not acceptance of the existing subset."}, {"id": "roadmap_mc02", "label": "MC02 Actual Financial Operations on Preview", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Acceptance: retained transaction and finalized-block evidence establishes exact financial integration. This contract remains an uncertified probe until the mandatory acceptance lineage is complete. Verify canonical finality rather than treating indexer inclusion as sufficient."}, {"id": "roadmap_mc03", "label": "MC03 Real Native Recursive Proof", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Acceptance: actual retained native IVC evidence for the exact fixed episode. A nonrecursive re-proof of the same table, hash chain or host verdict cannot substitute. MC03 supplies the terminal proof needed for F3, so full MC04 acceptance is not a prerequisite for MC03."}, {"id": "roadmap_mc04", "label": "MC04 Compiler and Ledger Correspondence", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Acceptance: the actual ledger consumes the checked history and applies exactly the authorized effects. A circuit preparation gadget or unconstrained host boolean is insufficient. Outcome signatures bind constraints; the concrete execution binds their digest and proves refinement."}, {"id": "roadmap_mc05", "label": "MC05 Mandatory Correctness and Intent Acceptance", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Acceptance: a required claim cannot be removed, downgraded or replaced with a simulation. Enforce cheap bounded admission before expensive verification."}, {"id": "roadmap_mc06", "label": "MC06 Private Handoff and Composition", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Acceptance: actual private multi-party history composition and its financial/ledger predicates, not merely a linear proof or shared-process demonstration. Reject authority amplification, debt erasure and lifecycle reset."}, {"id": "roadmap_mc07", "label": "MC07 Full ACTUS and DeFi Conformance", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Acceptance: no missing required fixture, field or behavior and no substituted taxonomy, permissive tolerance or unrelated validator. A row count or small public sample cannot close semantic, profile-proof, local-acceptance and Preview-acceptance evidence."}, {"id": "roadmap_mc08", "label": "MC08 Developer Workflow and Release Evidence", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Acceptance: a reproducible developer release whose advertised guarantees match retained evidence. Render from canonical signed bytes. Reject unknown semantic extensions and display/signature mismatches."}, {"id": "roadmap_rp01", "label": "RP01 Financial and Intent Semantics", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Define bounded independent traces for eight intent examples, three retained held-outs, all eight DeFi regression classes and five composition operators. Specify signed nominal-debt authority separately from token spending. Co-design canonical signing and display before freezing new authority fields. Full RP01 design map gates general successor profiles; it is not a prerequisite for the unchanged fixed-instance experiment. Preserves all 277 ACTUS fixtures, 32 ACTUS taxonomy dispositions and 72 historical DeFi rows."}, {"id": "roadmap_rp02", "label": "RP02 Complete Native History Route", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Specify what a private successor receives, which secrets remain private, how predecessor proofs compose, and how the final native accumulator decision reaches the actual Midnight verifier. Pin source and deployment versions separately. Resolve source interfaces and run independently admitted component probes before a new native campaign."}, {"id": "roadmap_rp03", "label": "RP03 Campaign Admission", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Freeze existing commands, candidate hashes, current Grok 4.6 high/fresh GPT-6 review records, bounded resources and stop conditions for each campaign. Preserve historical charges. A full MC07 campaign manifest is required for MC07, not for an earlier small probe. Each campaign requires its own RP03 record. Null campaign IDs reject admission."}, {"id": "roadmap_f0", "label": "F0 Feasibility and Ledger-Family Decision", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Establishes a reviewed proposed route without native execution, including finalizer arithmetic/constraint-fit estimates, go/no-go criteria and a ledger-family decision with explicit deployment-provenance limits. F0a cannot start until these decisions and a conservative reservation amendment are reviewed."}, {"id": "roadmap_f0a", "label": "F0a Admitted Component Authorship", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "roadmap_f1", "label": "F1 Component Probes", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Requires its own frozen implemented candidate, resource decision and current reviews before compilation or synthesis. All three F1 probe families must pass: transcript agreement, canonical export/import and constrained final pairing acceptance. No incomplete probe is waived. No F1 fixture may depend on the MC03 loan proof."}, {"id": "roadmap_contract_invariant", "label": "ContractInvariant", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "roadmap_intent_refinement", "label": "IntentRefinement", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "roadmap_transition_validity", "label": "TransitionValidity", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "roadmap_history_compliance", "label": "HistoryCompliance", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "ROADMAP.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "roadmap_pcd", "label": "Proof-Carrying Data", "file_type": "rationale", "source_fil